# Textual's member commands (`IRCClient.m:3282-3340`, 3738-3832): /op and
# its kin pack as many nicks per MODE as MODES allows; the ban family bans
# a member's *!user@host, nick!*@* when the address is unknown, or the nick
# as typed for someone not in the channel. A mode the server has no prefix
# for is refused.
! welcome
< :irc.test 005 textual CHANTYPES=# PREFIX=(ov)@+ MODES=3 KICKLEN=10 TOPICLEN=5 NETWORK=TestNet :are supported by this server
< :textual!u@h JOIN #c
> MODE #c
< :irc.test 353 textual = #c :@textual bob
< :irc.test 366 textual #c :End of NAMES list
> WHO #c
< :dave!~d@dave.host JOIN #c
! type #c /op dave bob carol erin
> MODE #c +ooo dave bob carol
> MODE #c +o erin
! type #c /deop #other  dave
> MODE #other -o dave
! type #c /devoice dave
> MODE #c -v dave
! type #c /halfop dave
? line #c The mode +h is not supported on this server
! type #c /voice
? line #c Invalid syntax: “VOICE [channel] <nickname>“
! type console /op dave
? line console This command can only be used with a channel.
? notice This command can only be used with a channel.
! type #c /ban dave
> MODE #c +b *!~d@dave.host
! type #c /unban bob
> MODE #c -b bob!*@*
! type #c /ban #other dave
> MODE #other +b dave
! type #c /quiet zed
> MODE #c +q zed
! type #c /unquiet zed
> MODE #c -q zed
! type #c /kb dave out
> MODE #c +b *!~d@dave.host
> KICK #c dave out
! type #c /kickban
? line #c Invalid syntax: “KICKBAN [channel] <nickname> [comment]“
! type #c /kick dave far too long a reason
? line #c You have exceeded the maximum kick message length for TestNet which is 10 characters. The end of your kick message may have been cut off.
> KICK #c dave :far too long a reason
! type #c /topic longer
? line #c You have exceeded the maximum topic length for TestNet which is 5 characters. The end of your topic may have been cut off.
> TOPIC #c longer
! type #c /topic short
> TOPIC #c short
! type #c /names #c,#d
> NAMES #c,#d
! type #c /names
? line #c Invalid syntax: “NAMES <channel>“
? registered textual
